    'Web design in West Palm Beach has one job for a local business: get someone nearby to find you on Google and call.',
    'West Palm Beach SEO builds and fixes websites with a page for every service and every town you cover.',
  ]}
  summary={[
    'What you get: a website with its own page for each service and each town, fast on a phone, with the call button easy to reach.',
    'Who it is for: contractors, restaurants, medical offices, and other local businesses with customers in West Palm Beach.',
    'How to start: a free 30-minute audit by phone or video. We look at your current website before the call.',
  ]}
  sections={[
    {
      h2: 'A page for every service and every town',
      paragraphs: [
        'Google ranks pages, not whole websites. A single Services page that lists ten things gives Google nothing specific to show when someone searches for one of them.',
        'So each service you sell gets its own page, and so does each town you work in. The page title and the main heading say the service and the town in plain words.',
      ],
    },
    {
      h2: 'Built for a phone first',
      paragraphs: [
        'Most local searches happen on a phone, usually by someone who wants to call. We build the phone layout first: the heading, a short answer, and the call button before anything else.',
