        'The mailing address also reaches past the city. Westgate, Haverhill, and parts of The Acreage have West Palm Beach addresses without being inside the city, and people there search for West Palm Beach businesses. We plan your pages around where your customers live.',
      ],
    },
    {
      h2: 'The website and the Google Business Profile work together',
      paragraphs: [
        'Your website backs up your Google Business Profile. The name, address, and phone number match on both, and the profile links to the page that fits each service.',
      ],
    },
  ]}
  areasTitle="Parts of West Palm Beach we cover"
